    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "In our grant we promised to deliver 'network modules' from the somatic mutation data of 300 colorectal tumours, and the report is due next month. We have the tumour-by-gene mutation counts, gene exon lengths, a cancer gene list and a pathway GMT in MSigDB format. What should we produce?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't tell yet which result you want, so I have not chosen a workflow.\n\nWith somatic mutations, the registered workflows can give these results:\n- Patient subtypes from somatic mutations -- gene mutation scores summarized into pathway mutation scores, then hierarchical clustering of the patients on them... (SAMBAR)\n\nWhich of these results do you want, or what question should the analysis answer?\n\nNothing was selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
